Package: swfx-launcher
Version: 0.6.2
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, x11-xserver-utils
Maintainer: neurocontrarian <neurocontrarian@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/neurocontrarian/swfx-launcher
Description: GTK4 launcher for SyndWarsFX
 Configures SyndWarsFX through config.ini and conf/rules.ini, exposing only
 the settings that actually work and refusing the combinations that fail.
 .
 The resolution list is built from xrandr, so a mode the screen does not
 provide cannot be picked. Aspect ratio is preserved on widescreen displays
 and restored when the game exits, videos can be enlarged or shown in a
 dedicated 4:3 mode, and both configuration files are backed up before every
 write.
 .
 The interface is available in French and English.
